    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2dfce81f4a2a92e72fea1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "机械EN的初次获得量提升（最大+2）\\n容易配置更多机械齿轮",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3645fab6941bd203577bea9f134c95ee7caced1dcf3bd36a41c8806cc9699b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "200",
        "67"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfa4226bcbe78673a4ba4040",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超速驱动槽的初始值提升\\n容易配置更多机械齿轮",
      "source_fingerprint": "5393428712486f8fb591fb7c1df7d2d98dfcc27775045404653521627035a9f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "200",
        "68"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba9983ac858b5d7cdd26c3e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "机械EN的初次获得量提升（最大+2）\\n根据研究Lv，训练效果上升量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f99798507dd0c067070db9e231955332b657bfe33b65341f1057ea441582673",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "200",
        "69"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:374df5912e9c8a630434eb74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超速驱动槽的初始值提升\\n研究Lv的初始值提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "700d13b3c48f4c05be725af601fb2c7034bfe4453410b2c15ea4a904ea0eed47",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "200",
        "70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03f0fc34e329c65d9b32c492",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "容易配置更多机械齿轮\\n研究Lv的初始值提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "046dca962cab558f2b90ab57b3ed17ea8972c6df39fd932ddb9f0ed968fb67be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "200",
        "71"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a55d1ff5e9fd6c515853217",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "部分事件效果将提升。\\n建设方案可用的规划成本将提升。\\n进行了三次及以上性能解锁后，可用规划成本进一步提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab910f04dd42fb5b6384e2a91d9fb981e53a882c2f112838652e58eba03b9828",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "200",
        "83"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ee172548e20dd5ffd1575a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "部分事件的效果将会提升\\n在首次作战会议及各阶段总结会中\\n可获得的 DP将会增加\\n当编组中包含 SSR [American Dream]夺金旅途时\\n获得的 DP 将会进一步提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c7b2ec939673995abf5ffd575efc27660e2bca313e7d9ce0d09f2f0506745d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "200",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c672826395517a4af24847",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color> ROUND1开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55cdab86f9b0061f086c3f8a4340e08a7e0792c6e40e8e03a5e75e9723c4c34a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
