      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95e5d8f16881f5b4b164639",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color> ROUND1开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55cdab86f9b0061f086c3f8a4340e08a7e0792c6e40e8e03a5e75e9723c4c34a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c363f74d9bc23689d268cf5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝不能错过<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67743667cd61e674d147f572524b630b9d53243b3d3df2e37939c48ee0640402",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20be3de04308571bfae94107",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "肯定胜负难料的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8695feac1c0962fa6a028e97469ad9b093e0a049dfaad8c1069974d2b2790917",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479331084fbfe0b5abff1a2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞争激烈的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color> ROUND1开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a0cdf98f67e300ccfe7dc6cebf25e935430958b01c62ba392b37d10fa59469a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b187e20b83b87611242cae80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对不会停下来，<color=#ff9900>群英月赛\\n<race_name></color> ROUND1。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989880e847f14768a3ef3e4763fc54e235cbebf3ba3a656d1e870b1fe63079ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:449efe9d8774e4b88898c3e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘齐聚，<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> ROUND1。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9edb066bb3c0178b49f6cc06f8cdb487d7109c8d82cb07264022e4580af7db3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eb576a73eb0678eba7885af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "才刚开始的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> ROUND1。",
      "source_fingerprint": "559bea2a8fadec909b45a64071cb32a6074fe38a8ef261697f283d2422466673",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84101559b18b2ace98e739e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "王牌云集，仅有三女神才知道结果，备受瞩目的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bc2c65b99115d664c9d45ceadce3e95a2f46f5fde017c72ed459b51110ff35",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edbf4af3db6e94bb6936a54a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从全国各地聚集而来的精锐，在热烈的欢呼声中展现魅力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abce797f7f15c3dda54d071839b7ba8bd01eb0fd11a00c718dc919c7b2a96631",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a72a66626cf35cc662a53f10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所有人的实力都是货真价实，谁赢都不奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "389ed646929795cb3d67f43bc5f117ac5fe0d23b26e5708771a398357d8b7a92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:675fbcd047d4e8a65142e5d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展翅飞向未来，备受期待的赛马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d799f73efa39e2bb85dfc80197c77ae2f42eee67bcbff9a113c3afdea59752",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d6c6655fbb38d799686667",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参赛的赛马娘都颇具实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494c891eb639886ec8887be192835407158e1972d24ba822b1981b2b7d046bbe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbc128f8936f60e8ba28c4db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "演员齐聚一堂，受众人瞩目的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dae00a974a9464e1650949aa577e687eb0084a76065855f8fa23ad0398122ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aad970f8d811d46a72e1c29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各赛马娘的实力在伯仲之间，能期待是场高水平的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af95488caa6b3af0186e27d9d878e280eb77b83e4d1fc77c8b579c4c5163779d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264a396090cd7e2cc00f3891",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "聚集了难得的优秀成员，是粉丝必看的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0b77bb1d166abbc1b1f60d7cd196ef68015b29669ad30ef6aac6706813eaed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc539988e8b03282b59a68fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加的都是强者，备受瞩目的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45cc2ffa58b92cd9a91422afa9b9d0180b7cc258c4d9b308d8776329a1e2154",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1fd2337c0a5de50d1792db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉丝也抱持高度期待的盛大竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de9b92ceaccc59711e6082b3ec3e85dd2a8ce9f8409ba7cfb825543e3552c9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77cce4b373e65791766a46c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "聚集了目标进入A组的三方，重要的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99d0bd4f186f702199e0184153bee9670071eaa3cd2c5af8eeac8403c244a1a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12bf3b05a765195f0d7da7d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "实力相当，在抵达终点前都不能移开视线的精彩竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f3ec4972d2e19e80d30bd3fbcdba7ae18bce324a724b2ce2277ed9b43b24fef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:747ba4fcac69d43b17768c65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<season>晴朗的<race_course>赛场，备受瞩目的赛马娘齐聚一堂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "060aa7ad8dd70abd44a3734b8f5b1599f556d052887e42687380f50ef5d1dd30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0e71965ec98b7c0a63f858",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不是赢，就是输！胜利者只有一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a014d1c0e8fa3108d64d2699e1bf709b1635bd04edb029a3b12881e4f7351bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ed739255beffd5f45c5f5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "任何赛马娘都会在此鼓起冲劲的重要场合。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64e68791ea0aedd3482e8326a4250f45e262d6215ec7c3e1ac9b1c9aeba3dac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf61087284d06acc4cfd7ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家抱着对胜利的强烈决心挑战对手们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91752906d51a6d566a72002b2b99c9e655de53754eb836e39c9283d45b645bf9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee61c615d108caf73881fa2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一场不论谁获胜都不奇怪的激烈竞赛就此开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29b0f7625731520ed41b67b6528c23c96594904c2d46c434d393cf740533748",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6bf545838ceb9a918c143e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到瞩目的赛马娘们一边竞争，一边奔驰在<race_distance>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74794e61ea3457739e8af9e7ec4c6eef761c4b4832131b3c074dd792c9c5a3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa3b512745bddb829ef0867",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比任何地方都长，也比任何地方都短的<race_course>的<race_distance>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22116d467121ec75700bc711bd442b1943a3931cb7d3de4342da94a2e4248d8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "1307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6830c6e4abec26652c383cc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "聚集了目标进入A组的三方，重要的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99d0bd4f186f702199e0184153bee9670071eaa3cd2c5af8eeac8403c244a1a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
